Auntie Coop wants us there.

151
00:06:22.809 --> 00:06:24.151
{\an8}so we're going.

152
00:06:24.251 --> 00:06:26.333
{\an8}Now. go get changed.

153
00:06:41.391 --> 00:06:43.974
Reliving the old
glory days. huh. Baker?

154
00:06:44.074 --> 00:06:45.937
[Chuckles]

155
00:06:46.037 --> 00:06:48.520
[No audio]

156
00:06:59.693 --> 00:07:01.916
Cassius: So where do
I stand. Mr. Mosely?

157
00:07:02.016 --> 00:07:03.397
{\an8}London didn't think the Eagles

158
00:07:03.497 --> 00:07:06.561
{\an8}would win a single game.
much less make the playoffs.

159
00:07:06.661 --> 00:07:09.445
{\an8}Everyone had written them off.

160
00:07:09.545 --> 00:07:11.607
{\an8}Not everyone.

161
00:07:11.707 --> 00:07:13.289
