167
00:07:27.246 --> 00:07:28.588
We'll just see about that.

168
00:07:28.688 --> 00:07:30.488
Well. London seems pretty
set in his decision.

169
00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:34.234
{\an8}London still has boosters
to answer to.

170
00:07:34.334 --> 00:07:38.960
{\an8}And lucky for you. I'm finally
