And he's kind of a nerd. too.

203
00:09:03.321 --> 00:09:04.702
I wouldn't worry about it.

204
00:09:04.802 --> 00:09:07.265
Just this morning.
you were the one

205
00:09:07.365 --> 00:09:10.149
