type of girl. Trust.

211
00:09:39.524 --> 00:09:41.466
Jordan: Principal London.
come on.

212
00:09:41.566 --> 00:09:42.868
Jordan. Cliff Mosely is

213
00:09:42.968 --> 00:09:44.546
