220
00:09:53.821 --> 00:09:55.803
That's exactly the point.
Jordan.

221
00:09:55.903 --> 00:09:57.485
Your father's right.

222
00:09:57.585 --> 00:09:59.243
With all that your family's
going through. it's best

223
