[Slaps counter. claps]

233
00:10:21.454 --> 00:10:22.872
Can we pick up the pace
a little bit?

234
00:10:22.896 --> 00:10:24.313
Breonna's gonna be here
any minute with the food.

235
00:10:24.337 --> 00:10:25.639
Yes. Uh. are you sure
you just

236
00:10:25.739 --> 00:10:26.819
don't want me to whip out
the Blacktop

